	(text "phil doesn't typically use the switch\nbecause he does that using the debugger\nhowever, he does place the capacitor\nas per the datasheet.\nfor me, I'll keep the switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.942 55.626 0)
		(effects
